                        "entry_id": "d63e7b28-cffe-3d0c-89b4-fc4c09aa7a01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pass to another offensive player who immediately shoots for the basket."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7678877-f751-4b0b-ad5c-437bd600fcf5",
                                "sense_id": "6faf3c3f-a003-312d-b48e-8c5025ab551c",
                                "text": "They have to get there however possible tonight to create not just layups but also kickout 3s."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe515c12-76bd-46bb-820c-77d9e755dfe0",
                                "sense_id": "6faf3c3f-a003-312d-b48e-8c5025ab551c",
                                "text": "On his first return scoring, against the Oilers, J.T. said, “I saw a hole on the right side, got a good kickout block and shot through.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7b9669b-720c-4b5e-85b6-32f99bbea639",
                                "sense_id": "6faf3c3f-a003-312d-b48e-8c5025ab551c",
                                "text": "In the short roll, playing 4-on-5 like a smaller Draymond, his job is simple: Read the defense and make the right play. Most of the time, it is either a lob, a floater or a kickout for a corner 3."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a55087b6-5552-3f81-b2f3-1c391cefd1df",
                        "entry_id": "d63e7b28-cffe-3d0c-89b4-fc4c09aa7a01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A kick made by the goalkeeper from the goal area."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "907c09cb-755f-448e-b91a-18afd4c07f5d",
                                "sense_id": "a55087b6-5552-3f81-b2f3-1c391cefd1df",
                                "text": "This is the style of kick made by goal keepers in soccer in a kickout and by players in the Rugby type of game in the kick-off ."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b3492f0-95ee-3f66-95cd-519cf82fb9d1",
                        "entry_id": "d63e7b28-cffe-3d0c-89b4-fc4c09aa7a01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A drop kick by a player on the side to return the ball back into play."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b067d23d-7080-4ad2-9aa3-376e327a579c",
                                "sense_id": "9b3492f0-95ee-3f66-95cd-519cf82fb9d1",
                                "text": "In the great Michigan game of 1903, it was he who got the ball on the kickout."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd2a0228-5d02-405b-a559-64c4b5461457",
                                "sense_id": "9b3492f0-95ee-3f66-95cd-519cf82fb9d1",
                                "text": "Jones caught the kickout on the fifteen-yard line and Hudson kicked goal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fded8be-12a9-4128-95e7-96bc4da84c1c",
                                "sense_id": "9b3492f0-95ee-3f66-95cd-519cf82fb9d1",
                                "text": "Another change requires that on the kickout the opponents line up on the 20-yard line, instead of on the 25-yard line, and that the ball be kicked from some point behind the 20-yard line."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cd47248-69b8-4285-af59-7e90e0069b00",
                                "sense_id": "9b3492f0-95ee-3f66-95cd-519cf82fb9d1",
                                "text": "The kickout was fumbled and Barrett lost his chance to try for the goal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9cd5dd6-0f5f-4d1b-9f9a-aabb49ae4f4a",
                                "sense_id": "9b3492f0-95ee-3f66-95cd-519cf82fb9d1",
                                "text": "“We called [the play] 26 Blast on that play and I was reading Jaydon Wright’s kickout block on the end,” Smith said."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "37a4c263-9b4a-3f1a-9e60-3b1ecd74a009",
                        "entry_id": "d63e7b28-cffe-3d0c-89b4-fc4c09aa7a01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A penalty for holding or sinking the driver"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "508a03bf-a4b5-402e-bf24-19cb20bf912d",
                                "sense_id": "37a4c263-9b4a-3f1a-9e60-3b1ecd74a009",
                                "text": "Juliet Lawrence led the Crushers in Monday's neck-and-neck loss with 3 goals and had 3 steals and a caused kickout."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a373692-7715-4cd7-9b78-d3fafd3ec06e",
                                "sense_id": "37a4c263-9b4a-3f1a-9e60-3b1ecd74a009",
                                "text": "Strohson tallied a goal, two steals and two exclusions earned. Chimilar finished with an assist, three steals and a kickout drawn."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02097e8c-de3c-4be3-bb4a-231a5401817c",
                                "sense_id": "37a4c263-9b4a-3f1a-9e60-3b1ecd74a009",
                                "text": "Taye Luke also scored for Santa Ynez, while accounting for one assist, a steal and one kickout."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "54853315-f6ea-374f-a3a5-a5fe052f3c5c",
                        "entry_id": "d63e7b28-cffe-3d0c-89b4-fc4c09aa7a01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A hole in the playfield that briefly captures the ball and then ejects it."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
