                                "sense_id": "54853315-f6ea-374f-a3a5-a5fe052f3c5c",
                                "text": "We're supposed to be testing them, probing for valuable information, learning that this particular kickout always feeds the ball to the left flipper, that tilt bob is set tight, and this game is sloped so steeply that the right ramp is hard to hit."
